[build prof=A/E ear=12 sha=12+1+3 cri=3][Shroud of Distress][Shadow Form][Armor of Earth][Ebon Battle Standard of Honor][Sliver Armor][Dark Escape]["I Am Unstoppable!"][Death's Charge][/build]
