== Counters ==
* Whirling Wisps have [[gww:Lyssa's Assault|Lyssa's Assault]], which they tend to use randomly. Use your blocking skills to counter this.
* Jotun Skullsmashers have [[gww:Skull Crack|Skull Crack]]. Kill them as fast as possible and use your blocking skills to prevent them from building adrenaline.
* Rubberbanding.
* Soul Rending Shriek.
* Improper energy management.

